# API Endpoints

## Public (No Auth)

```
GET  /health           204 No Content (liveness). Load lives on /stats.
GET  /metrics          Prometheus text (BFE_METRICS_ENABLED, default on; unauthenticated)
GET  /info             Engine identity
```

## Devtools (disabled in prod by default — BFE_DEVTOOLS_ENABLED)

```
GET  /                 Swagger UI
GET  /api/openapi      OpenAPI 3.x spec (also via BFE_EXPOSE_OPENAPI_SPEC)
GET  /admin/graphiql   Playground with example tabs
```

## Authenticated (JWT Bearer)

### Process Catalog

```
GET    /processes                              List deployed processes
GET    /processes/{model_id}                   Process metadata (?includeXml)
GET    /processes/{model_id}/versions          Version history (?includeXml)
POST   /processes                              Deploy BPMN (JSON: {"sources": [...]})
POST   /processes/{model_id}/start             Start new PI (disabled process → 422)
PUT    /processes/{model_id}/enable            Enable process (204)
PUT    /processes/{model_id}/disable           Disable process (204)
DELETE /processes/{model_id}                   Undeploy process (204)
DELETE /processes/{model_id}/versions/{ver}    Delete version (204)
```

### User Tasks

```
PUT    /user-tasks/{fniId}/finish         Complete with result (204)
PUT    /user-tasks/{fniId}/cancel         Cancel + abort PI (204)
```

### Process Instances

```
PUT    /process-instances/{id}/abort      Abort running PI (204)
PUT    /process-instances/{id}/retry      Retry terminal PI (fatal/aborted/error)
DELETE /process-instances/{id}            Delete terminal PI (204)
```

### Messages / Signals / Escalations

```
POST   /messages/{message_name}/trigger              Publish message
POST   /signals/{signal_name}/trigger                Broadcast signal
POST   /escalations/{escalation_code}/trigger        Inject escalation
```

### Timers

```
POST   /timer-events/{fniId}/trigger                 Fire waiting timer FNI
GET    /timer-schedules                              List Timer Start schedules
GET    /timer-schedules/{id}                         Show one schedule
PUT    /timer-schedules/{id}/enable                  Enable schedule (204)
PUT    /timer-schedules/{id}/disable                 Disable schedule (204)
```

### Decisions (DMN)

```
GET    /decisions                                    List deployed decisions
GET    /decisions/{model_id}                         Metadata (?includeXml)
GET    /decisions/{model_id}/versions                Version history
POST   /decisions                                    Deploy DMN
POST   /decisions/{model_id}/evaluate                Ad-hoc evaluate
POST   /decisions/{model_id}/versions/{ver}/evaluate Evaluate pinned version
POST   /decisions/{model_id}/services/{id}/evaluate  Evaluate Decision Service
PUT    /decisions/{model_id}/enable                  Enable (204)
PUT    /decisions/{model_id}/disable                 Disable (204)
DELETE /decisions/{model_id}                         Undeploy (204)
DELETE /decisions/{model_id}/versions/{ver}          Delete version (204)
```

### Ad-hoc subprocesses

`{id}` is the child process instance ID.

```
GET    /adhoc-subprocesses/{id}/activities
POST   /adhoc-subprocesses/{id}/activities/{activity_id}/activate
POST   /adhoc-subprocesses/{id}/complete
GET    /adhoc-subprocesses/{id}/status
```

### Observability

```
GET    /stats                             Engine snapshot (camelCase; engine.load)
```

## GraphQL

```
POST   /api/v1/graphql                    Queries only (no mutations)
```

## WebSocket

```
ws://host:port/socket                    Phoenix Channels
Topics: engine:events | process_instance:<id> | user_tasks:pending
```
